Creating our ECR Repo
=====================
* Create an ECR repository
* Authenticate Docker with ECR registry
* Tag our Docker image and give it a new name
* Push our image in the ECR Repo
* Verify if our image is there


IAM USER [AWS]
===============
* IAM USER is a seperate login identity you CREATE inside your AWS Account for a specific  person or application
* It is an AWS Service that controls who can do what
* It can have access keys 
* it can have permissions that say what its allowed to do e.g managing an s3 bucket


